    "7df300e2-c639-4a1c-a8c7-647486271e3b": {
      "type": "advanced-content",
      "blocks": {
        "template--15919760736420__7df300e2-c639-4a1c-a8c7-647486271e3b-167900744345bc434f-1": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Our Competitive \"Edge\"</h2>\n<p>Not all glass chairmats are created equal. We are the exclusive providers of glass office mats featuring a patented beveled edge, uniquely designed to enhance your <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/blogs/news/choosing-the-best-office-chair-mat\">office experience</a>:</p>\n\n<div class=\"edge-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3.75 13.5l10.5-11.25L12 10.5h8.25L9.75 21.75 12 13.5H3.75z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Smooth transitions with no abrupt drop-offs make moving on and off the mat easy.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9.813 15.904L9 18.75l-.813-2.846a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09-3.09L2.25 12l2.846-.813a4.5 4.5 0 003.09-3.09L9 5.25l.813 2.846a4.5 4.5 0 003.09 3.09L15.75 12l-2.846.813a4.5 4.5 0 00-3.09 3.09z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Elegant design with a 1-inch full <a href=\"https://glasschairmats.com/pages/benefits-of-glass\">beveled edge</a> that seamlessly fits any office decor.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75m-3-7.036A11.959 11.959 0 013.598 6 11.99 11.99 0 003 9.749c0 5.592 3.824 10.29 9 11.623 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.31-.21-2.571-.598-3.751h-.152c-3.196 0-6.1-1.248-8.25-3.285z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>The beveled edge lies flat on the floor to prevent tripping or shoe damage.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M16.5 18.75h-9m9 0a3 3 0 013 3h-15a3 3 0 013-3m9 0v-3.375c0-.621-.503-1.125-1.125-1.125h-.871M7.5 18.75v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h.872m5.007 0H9.497m5.007 0a7.454 7.454 0 01-.982-3.172M9.497 14.25a7.454 7.454 0 00.981-3.172M5.25 4.236c-.982.143-1.954.317-2.916.52A6.003 6.003 0 007.73 9.728M5.25 4.236V4.5c0 2.108.966 3.99 2.48 5.228M5.25 4.236V2.721C7.456 2.41 9.71 2.25 12 2.25c2.291 0 4.545.16 6.75.47v1.516M7.73 9.728a6.726 6.726 0 002.748 1.35m8.272-6.842V4.5c0 2.108-.966 3.99-2.48 5.228m2.48-5.492a46.32 46.32 0 012.916.52 6.003 6.003 0 01-5.395 4.972m0 0a6.726 6.726 0 01-2.749 1.35m0 0a6.772 6.772 0 01-3.044 0\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Backed by a lifetime warranty against cracks or chipping.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2.25 21h19.5m-18-18v18m10.5-18v18m6-13.5V21M6.75 6.75h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75m3-6h.75m-.75 3h.75m-.75 3h.75M6.75 21v-3.375c0-.621.504-1.125 1.125-1.125h2.25c.621 0 1.125.504 1.125 1.125V21M3 3h12m-.75 4.5H21m-3.75 3.75h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0 3h.008v.008h-.008v-.008zm0 3h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>Ideal for both home offices and traditional office settings.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M3.75 3v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 16.5h2.25M3.75 3h-1.5m1.5 0h16.5m0 0h1.5m-1.5 0v11.25A2.25 2.25 0 0118 16.5h-2.25m-7.5 0h7.5m-7.5 0l-1 3m8.5-3l1 3m0 0l.5 1.5m-.5-1.5h-9.5m0 0l-.5 1.5M9 11.25v1.5M12 9v3.75m3-6v6\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p>The only glass chair mat with a patented, beveled edge.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.edge-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 16px 24px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.edge-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.edge-icon-wrap {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  background: #f0f5f2;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.edge-icon-wrap svg {\n  width: 17px;\n  height: 17px;\n  color: #4a7a65;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 749px) {\n  .edge-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>",
