        "liquid_E4crQd": {
          "type": "liquid",
          "settings": {
            "code": "<h2>Why Glass Office Mats?</h2>\n<p>Using a glass mat comes with several advantages:</p>\n\n<div class=\"edge-grid\">\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M11.42 15.17L17.25 21A2.652 2.652 0 0021 17.25l-5.877-5.877M11.42 15.17l2.496-3.03c.317-.384.74-.626 1.208-.766M11.42 15.17l-4.655 5.653a2.548 2.548 0 11-3.586-3.586l6.837-5.63m5.108-.233c.55-.164 1.163-.188 1.743-.14a4.5 4.5 0 004.486-6.336l-3.276 3.277a3.004 3.004 0 01-2.25-2.25l3.276-3.276a4.5 4.5 0 00-6.336 4.486c.091 1.076-.071 2.264-.904 2.95l-.102.085m-1.745 1.437L5.909 7.5H4.5L2.25 3.75l1.5-1.5L7.5 4.5v1.409l4.26 4.26m-1.745 1.437l1.745-1.437m6.615 8.206L15.75 15.75M4.867 19.125h.008v.008h-.008v-.008z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><b>Durability:</b> Unlike traditional plastic chair mats, glass mats do not wear out or become discolored over time.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 010-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178z\"/><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><b>Aesthetic Appeal:</b> Clear and sleek, our innovative glass office mats blend seamlessly with any office décor.</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"edge-item\">\n    <div class=\"edge-icon-wrap\">\n      <svg fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" d=\"M9 12.75L11.25 15 15 9.75M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"/></svg>\n    </div>\n    <p><b>Smooth Surface:</b> Ensures easy movement of office chairs, reducing strain on your back and legs.</p>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.edge-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n  gap: 16px 24px;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.edge-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  gap: 12px;\n}\n\n.edge-icon-wrap {\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 36px;\n  height: 36px;\n  background: #f0f5f2;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-top: 2px;\n}\n\n.edge-icon-wrap svg {\n  width: 17px;\n  height: 17px;\n  color: #4a7a65;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 749px) {\n  .edge-grid {\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n  }\n}\n</style>",
            "width": "100%",
            "alignment": "center"
          }
        }
